# Toggling done on one task leaves odd but valid lines elsewhere exactly as they were.
file <<END
Work: @area(job)  
	- Report @done(2026-09-01) @priority(1)
	- Email  bob   @due(2026-10-20)

* star item
+ plus item
			jumped
foo@bar.com Proj:@x
Home:
	- Dishes
END
keys G x
see ✔ Dishes
quit
saved <<END
Work: @area(job)  
	- Report @done(2026-09-01) @priority(1)
	- Email  bob   @due(2026-10-20)

* star item
+ plus item
			jumped
foo@bar.com Proj:@x
Home:
	- Dishes @done({today})
END
